OL,3,GNEWSAGiant veg records smashed despite
OL,4,A'bonkers' summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven giant vegetables are believed to
OL,7,Fhave smashed Guinness World Records as
OL,8,Fcompetitive growers showed off their
OL,9,Fsupersized produce at competition.
OL,11,FThe provisional records were set on
OL,12,FFriday at the National Giant Vegetables
OL,13,FChampionship, part of the Malvern
OL,14,FAutumn Show at the Three Counties
OL,15,FShowground in Worcestershire.
OL,17,FAmong the potential record holders was
OL,18,Fa 26.02kg (4st 1.8lb) beetroot, a
OL,19,F7.808kg (1st 3.2lb) sunflower head and
OL,20,Fa cucumber plant measuring more than
OL,21,F7.5m (24.6ft).
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
