OL,3,GNEWSAGiant veg records smashed despite
OL,4,A'bonkers' summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe achievements came despite a
OL,7,Fchallenging summer for growers, with
OL,8,Frecord-breaker Graham Barratt - who
OL,9,Fpresented the giant cucumber plant -
OL,10,Fdescribing the weather as "bonkers".
